            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.3.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h3>BarDeck 1.3.0</h3>
<p><strong>New</strong></p>
<ul>
  <li><em>Now Playing</em> buttons show the track, artist and cover art from Apple Music, Spotify, Qobuz or a Sonos speaker, and play or pause with a tap.</li>
  <li><em>Stock prices</em>: a button for any share or index, with the day&#8217;s change and a small chart.</li>
  <li><em>Compact or Normal</em> size: every button is one height, and the whole bar can be switched to a larger Normal size from the right-click menu.</li>
  <li><em>Licences</em> are now activated online and work on 2 Macs. <em>Licence&hellip;</em> in the menu shows your key and lets you deactivate a Mac to move it. Copy and paste now work in every BarDeck text box.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
