            <description><![CDATA[<h3>BarDeck 1.1.1</h3>
<p><strong>New: Zoom and Teams</strong></p>
<ul>
  <li>Two new ready-made sets: <em>Zoom</em> (mic, camera, share screen, raise hand, chat, participants and a red Leave button) and <em>Teams</em> (mic, camera, share, raise hand and Leave).</li>
  <li>Right-click the bar and choose <em>Add app preset</em>. The buttons appear while the call window is in front, and BarDeck never takes focus from it.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
