        <item>
            <title>1.1.0</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 21:59:19 +0100</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>3</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.1.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h3>BarDeck 1.1</h3>
<p><strong>New: controls</strong></p>
<ul>
  <li>Right-click the bar and choose <em>Add control</em> to add a <strong>volume slider</strong>, a <strong>brightness slider</strong>, play/pause, next and previous track, mute and an <strong>emoji picker</strong>.</li>
  <li>Buttons that control <strong>Music</strong> and <strong>Spotify</strong> directly.</li>
  <li>The brightness slider works with the built-in display and Apple's own displays.</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>New: share your setup</strong></p>
<ul>
  <li><em>Share layout</em> exports your whole layout, or just one stack or one app's set, and imports other people's. Your licence is never included.</li>
  <li>You can remove personal details (paths, pasted text, commands) before sharing, and importing warns about buttons that run shell commands.</li>
  <li>Importing merges instead of piling up copies.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
